<body lang="EN-US" link="#467886" vlink="#96607D" style="word-wrap:break-word">
<div class="WordSection1">
<p class="MsoNormal">One year ago tomorrow you dismissed me from your volunteer program and gave me 24 hours to vacate Honeyman State Park.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">I spent that year building this.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a href="https://rswfire.com/?mode=atlas&amp;center=43.93035%2C-124.10868&amp;zoom=15">rswfire.com</a><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">And now I&#8217;m building this.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a href="https://youtu.be/W9gOYbHX32I">https://youtu.be/W9gOYbHX32I</a><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><b>There was no mechanism that kept me safe in your parks.<o:p></o:p></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">I am now seeking representation to change that.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">For everyone.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Forever.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
